{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consciousness...  Where? Unknown. Who are all these dudes in robes? Only one way forward: through the door.</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962990/extras/86d898237eef3e4084e96e33722a79d4.avif?t=1763936636\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the afterlife\u2019s strangest waiting room, where each run reshapes the world, the dangers, and your very questionable chances of survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step pushes you closer to the truth of why you are here, and what this place wants from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the shifting paths. Gather weapons imbued with magic. Embrace (or suffer) the curses that twist your journey. Meet things that range from charming to troubling, all in a glorious retro pixelated colorscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962990/extras/892fe5e369d9cca2501269c45886aba4.avif?t=1763936636\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong><br>\u2022 Chaotic, colorful roguelite runs<br>\u2022 Controller or mouse and keyboard support<br>\u2022 Metagame unlocks that change future attempts<br>\u2022 Creatures with personality, including one total jerk<br>\u2022 Weapons that go from helpful to unhinged<br>\u2022 Levels that stay loud, bright, and full of nonsense<br>\u2022 Encounters worth remembering<br>\u2022 Cheese encouraged combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You Are Dead</strong> keeps growing with new features and content. Step through the door again and see what the afterlife serves you next.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/s